          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkalamuleje magambo mwa cilungamo ni mwangali lusagu ndaŵi josope. Naga mkuja kutenda myoyo, timkatamilicice mcilambo citakampe AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu.",
          "type": "text",
